        "content": "<p>The preadditive structure on the category <code>HomologicalComplex Cᵒᵖ c</code> when <code>C</code> is preadditive is no longer found because the category structure on <code>HomologicalComplex</code> depends on the <code>HasZeroMorphisms</code> instance that is deduced from the <code>Preadditive</code> structure, and there is a diamond at reducible transparency with the two ways to obtain the <code>HasZeroMorphisms</code> instance on <code>Cᵒᵖ</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Homology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Additive</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Preadditive</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Opposite</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CategoryTheory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Limits</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Category</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Preadditive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">ι</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ComplexShape</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ι</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isDefEq</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">respectTransparency</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Preadditive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">HomologicalComplex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"bp\">ᵒᵖ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">infer_instance</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">instPreadditiveOpposite</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">preadditiveHasZeroMorphisms</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">hasZeroMorphismsOpposite</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Preadditive</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">preadditiveHasZeroMorphisms</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible_and_instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- fails</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I am not sure how to fix this?!</p>",
